Description: minimal low-level HTTP client (v2 line, installs as httpcore2)
 httpcore2 is Pydantic's actively-developed next-generation rewrite of
 httpcore, published under the httpx2/httpcore2 project (the "v2" line
 of the httpx/httpcore ecosystem). It installs its own top-level
 "httpcore2" Python module, side by side with the unrelated, still
 separately maintained python3-httpcore ("v1" httpcore) package.
 .
 Packaged to satisfy mcp (>= 2.0.0b2)'s dependency on httpx2, itself
 needed for the fastmcp 4.0.0a2 migration.
